    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IUPAC</mi></math> name of following compound (P) is :<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6067bd1e-ec95-4e0e-b7ca-236711285ed8.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 201px;\"/></p>",
